b-20 px-6 md:px-16 lg:px-28 max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full\"><div class=\"mb-12\"><span class=\"font-body text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#797979] block mb-2\">Plane Architect<!-- --> • <!-- -->Dhaka, Bangladesh<!-- --> Dispatches</span><h1 class=\"font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-normal text-black tracking-tight\">News, Monographs &amp; Dispatches</h1></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12\"><a class=\"group flex flex-col border-b border-neutral-100 pb-8\" href=\"/news/dhaka-art-center-inauguration/\"><article><div class=\"relative mb-4 aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-neutral-100\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513694203232-719a280e022f?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Dhaka Contemporary Art Center Celebrates Grand Opening\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105\"/></div><div class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#797979] font-body\"><span>MARCH 2026</span><span>•</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-black\">Architecture</span><span>•</span><span>4 min read</span></div><h2 class=\"mb-2 font-display text-lg font-normal leading-snug text-black transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-75\">Dhaka Contemporary Art Center Celebrates Grand Opening</h2><p class=\"font-body text-xs leading-relaxed font-light text-neutral-600\">Plane Architect&#x27;s 48,000 m² cultural complex on Dhaka&#x27;s waterfront opens to the public, inaugurating new civic galleries and shaded water courtyards.</p></article></a><a class=\"group flex flex-col border-b border-neutral-100 pb-8\" href=\"/news/brahmaputra-campus-groundbreaking/\"><article><div class=\"relative mb-4 aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-neutral-100\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366811353-6870744d04b2?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Groundbreaking Ceremony for Brahmaputra Ecological Campus\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105\"/></div><div class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#797979] font-body\"><span>FEBRUARY 2026</span><span>•</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-black\">Education</span><span>•</span><span>3 min read</span></div><h2 class=\"mb-2 font-display text-lg font-normal leading-snug text-black transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-75\">Groundbreaking Ceremony for Brahmaputra Ecological Campus</h2><p class=\"font-body text-xs leading-relaxed font-light text-neutral-600\">Construction begins on South Asia&#x27;s largest engineered bamboo research campus in Mymensingh.</p></article></a><a class=\"group flex flex-col border-b border-neutral-100 pb-8\" href=\"/news/gulshan-botanical-award/\"><article><div class=\"relative mb-4 aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-neutral-100\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577495508048-b635879837f1?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Gulshan Botanical Pavilion Wins South Asian Urban Landscape Prize\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105\"/></div><div class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#797979] font-body\"><span>JANUARY 2026</span><span>•</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-black\">Landscape</span><span>•</span><span>5 min read</span></div><h2 class=\"mb-2 font-display text-lg font-normal leading-snug text-black transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-75\">Gulshan Botanical Pavilion Wins South Asian Urban Landscape Prize</h2><p class=\"font-body text-xs leading-relaxed font-light text-neutral-600\">Recognized for restoring native wetlands and introducing microclimatic thermal comfort to central Dhaka.</p></article></a><a class=\"group flex flex-col border-b border-neutral-100 pb-8\" href=\"/news/sustainability-monograph-release/\"><article><div class=\"relative mb-4 aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-neutral-100\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503387762-592deb58ef4e?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Plane Architect Publishes New Monograph: &#x27;Geometry in the Delta&#x27;\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105\"/></div><div class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#797979] font-body\"><span>DECEMBER 2025</span><span>•</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-black\">Publications</span><span>•</span><span>6 min read</span></div><h2 class=\"mb-2 font-display text-lg font-normal leading-snug text-black transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-75\">Plane Architect Publishes New Monograph: &#x27;Geometry in the Delta&#x27;</h2><p class=\"font-body text-xs leading-relaxed font-light text-neutral-600\">A comprehensive review of 10 years of architectural research, flood resilience, and low-carbon materials in Bangladesh.</p></article></a></div></div><footer class=\"w-full border-t border-neutral-800 bg-black font-body text-[#c6cec9]\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1600px] px-5 py-12 sm:px-8 md:py-16 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 border-b border-white/15 pb-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.7fr_0.9fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-12\"><div><a href=\"/\" class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer select-none mb-5\" aria-label=\"Plane Architect - Homepage\"><img src=\"/logo.png\" alt=\"Plane Architect\" class=\"h-12 brightness-0 invert sm:h-14 lg:h-16 w-auto object-contain transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-75\"/></a><p class=\"max-w-xs text-sm leading-6 text-[#c6cec9]\">Plane Architect is a Dhaka-based practice working across architecture, landscape, and place.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex gap-2\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/plane.architect/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" title=\"Instagram\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/25 text-[#e5ebe7] transition-colors hover:bord